CREATE TABLE "CampaignExperiment" ("id" TEXT NOT NULL,"agencyId" TEXT NOT NULL,"createdById" TEXT NOT NULL,"name" TEXT NOT NULL,"channel" TEXT NOT NULL,"bodyA" TEXT NOT NULL,"bodyB" TEXT NOT NULL,"filters" JSONB NOT NULL DEFAULT '{}',"sampleSize" INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 20,"winnerMetric" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'REPLY',"status" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'DRAFT',"campaignAId" TEXT,"campaignBId" TEXT,"winner" TEXT,"remainingCampaignId" TEXT,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"evaluatedAt" TIMESTAMP(3),"updatedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL,CONSTRAINT "CampaignExperiment_pkey" PRIMARY KEY ("id"));CREATE INDEX "CampaignExperiment_agencyId_createdAt_idx" ON "CampaignExperiment"("agencyId","createdAt");
